# The app as it ships: make a timer, look at it, come back to the list.
# Small enough to be the smoke test, and it is the scene to run on aplite when
# checking whether a change still fits in that platform's 24 KB.

note an empty app opens straight into the duration picker
shot picker
press select        # move off the hours field
press up 3          # three minutes
press select        # move to the seconds field
press select        # confirm -- the timer lands and its detail view opens
shot detail
press back
shot menu
